  {
   "id": 520306,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/e902a0ab9e316ff5.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Richard H. Nagelberg, DDS/<i>Inside Dental Technology</i>)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>Plaque is a colorless or pale yellow layer that forms on the teeth due to bacterial action. The image shows how plaque forms.</p>\n<p>Which option describes plaque?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1016675,
     "content_html": "It is a viral infection."
    },
    {
     "id": 1016676,
     "content_html": "It is a reemerging disease."
    },
    {
     "id": 1016677,
     "content_html": "It is a biofilm."
    },
    {
     "id": 1016678,
     "content_html": "It is an antibiotic resistance strain of bacteria."
    }
   ],
